Description: occam compiler and runtime system
 Razor is a compiler, runtime, and toolset for the occam programming
 language. It includes the occ21 compiler, the tranx86 native-code
 translator, the CCSP runtime, occam libraries, documentation tools, and the
 razor and occbuild command-line drivers.
